silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_02_sections_03_concrete_anchor_5#waterintaketarget silm:hasLongDescription "The WaterIntakeTarget is the water-intake target (200ml/day). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Constituent5,3', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
